0aa71ed358d42b67b39c9093ea6428cc906bb249c414b9f78f8ce4da36a8b480ea198c2fa3a12214d6206e30881b6f370adf61625ddf36fcecd2794d75d3762f  0100-test-Make-test_class_scope-ready-for-pytest-v9.1.patch
"
